      },
      "message": "fix(data): guard boundary conditions in vmv.v.i element update\n\nAdd boundary checks to the concatenation-based element update to\nprevent invalid bit-slice ranges (msb < lsb) when the element\ntouches bit 0 or bit VLEN-1 of the vector register.\n\nThe direct LHS bit-slice approach (v[vd][msb:lsb] = val) cannot be\nused here because the IDL parser does not support nested array access\non the LHS, and the C++ backend's bit_insert fails with runtime-\nunknown VLEN.\n\nFixes #1618",
